### Get all inventory items
GET {{host}}/api/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get inventory item by id (use id returned from Create request)
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get inventory item by id error 404
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create inventory item
POST {{host}}/api/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "venueId": 1,
  "name": "Chess set",
  "totalQuantity": 10,
  "availableQuantity": 7
}

### Create inventory item error 400 (missing required fields)
POST {{host}}/api/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "totalQuantity": 10
}

### Create inventory item error 400 (availableQuantity exceeds totalQuantity)
POST {{host}}/api/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "venueId": 1,
  "name": "Chess set",
  "totalQuantity": 5,
  "availableQuantity": 10
}

### Update inventory item (use id returned from Create request)
PUT {{host}}/api/inventory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "venueId": 1,
  "name": "Chess set",
  "totalQuantity": 10,
  "availableQuantity": 4
}

### Update inventory item error 404
PUT {{host}}/api/inventory/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "venueId": 1,
  "name": "Chess set",
  "totalQuantity": 10,
  "availableQuantity": 4
}

### Delete inventory item (use id returned from Create request)
DELETE {{host}}/api/inventory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete inventory item error 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/inventory/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}